      <p>${String(t)} hues, each on ${String(e.tiers.length)} contrast tiers, in a default and a muted version, for light and dark, for three kinds of screen. That's ${String(o)} colours, plus brown. They all follow the same rules, so you only have to learn the rules once.</p>
